    {
      "id": "writing_7",
      "consequence": {
        "god_only": "That very night, Belshazzar was killed. Babylon fell — and the court recalled how Daniel's words had always cut true, never softened for safety.",
        "mixed": "That very night, Belshazzar was killed. Babylon fell — and those who remembered Daniel's earlier compromises wondered if this last, unflinching reading had been worth the risk.",
